  "id": 10039430185277,
  "title": "VIVE Flow With Controller",
  "handle": "21071655",
  "body_html": "<h1>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Simple, splendid VR glasses.</span>\n</h1>\n<p><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Virtual reality doesn't have to be complicated. Start your journey with VIVE Flow. Easy to use, easy to carry, easy to share.</span></p>\n<div class=\"video-info-item\">\n<div class=\"text-area\">\n<h3 class=\"word-title type20-pdp-title\">\n<span class=\"font-thin\">One VR device, </span>two controller modes.<sup>2</sup>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"word-text type20-pdp-copy\">Pair your phone to bring your favorite apps and streaming services with you into VR.<sup>3</sup><span> </span>Or use the controller for seamless navigation and sharing.<sup>4</sup><button class=\"add-to-cart-button   slug-button vive20-btn\" type=\"button\" data-gtm=\"add-to-cart-button\"><span class=\"text-block\"></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"video-info-item\">\n<div class=\"video-area\">\n<span class=\"font-thin\"></span><br>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"video-area\">\n<span class=\"font-thin\">Sturdy and stable, </span>light and compact.</h3>\n<div class=\"text-area\">\n<div class=\"word-text type20-pdp-copy\">At just 189 g, these foldable VR glasses are the pinnacle of portability. Explore VIVERSE or your virtual cinema at home or on the go.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"video-info-item\">\n<div class=\"video-area\">\n<div class=\"image-block move-content\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-area\">\n<h3 class=\"word-title type20-pdp-title\">\n<span class=\"font-thin\">Immersion for you, </span>enjoyment for all.</h3>\n<div class=\"word-text type20-pdp-copy\">Let them join in on the fun. Screen mirroring to other devices offers those around you a window into virtual realms.</div>\n<div class=\"word-text type20-pdp-copy\">\n<p> </p>\n<h2>Comfortable and customizable.</h2>\n<div class=\"wording-area\">\n<div class=\"text-copy type20-pdp-copy text-fix-widow\">Whether you're streaming movies on a big screen<sup>3</sup><span> </span>or attending events remotely, VIVE Flow makes your time in VR as pleasant as possible.</div>\n<div class=\"text-copy type20-pdp-copy text-fix-widow\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"text-copy type20-pdp-copy text-fix-widow\">\n<p><strong>Adjustable focus—</strong>Turn the diopter dials to optimize your view in each lens and get the best level of visual clarity.</p>\n<p><strong>Natural fit—</strong>Rests on the sides of your head like a real pair of glasses.5 Wearing VR never felt so good.</p>\n<p><strong>Eye comfort mode—</strong>Minimize eye strain and relax before bed. Or whenever you'd like.</p>\n<p><strong>VR library management—</strong>Get parental controls and other features with the VIVE Guardian app on Android.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"video-area\">\n<div class=\"video-list\">\n<div class=\"video-item active\">\n<div class=\"video-text\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-title type20-pdp-title txt-color-white txt-m-color-black text-fix-widow\">\n<span class=\"font-thin\">Individual accounts, </span>personal experiences.</h2>\n<div class=\"text-copy type20-pdp-copy txt-color-white txt-m-color-black text-fix-widow\">Switching users? Log in with your profile to access your favorite VR titles and content.</div>\n<div class=\"text-copy type20-pdp-copy txt-color-white txt-m-color-black text-fix-widow\"><br></div>\n<h2 class=\"product-spec-list-item\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0926/0489/1453/files/vive-flow-accounts.jpg?v=1764621790\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"product-spec-list-item\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <br>Specs</h2>\n<div class=\"product-spec-list-item\">\n<p><strong>Form Factor: </strong>Ultra lightweight, glasses-like, foldable</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Memory &amp; Storage: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">4GB RAM + 64GB ROM</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Weight: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">189g (1.2M cable additional 50g), All units of measurements may vary slightly according to manufacturing tolerance</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Resolution: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">3200 x 1600 pixels combined (2 x 2.1” LCD 1600 x 1600 pixels per eye)</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Field of view: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Up to 100 degrees</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Refresh Rate: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">75 Hz</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Hygiene: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Replaceable face gasket and temple pads</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Thermals: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Active cooling for stable performance and increased user comfort</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Audio: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Stereo speakers with spatial audio support, Dual microphones with echo and noise cancellation, Supports Bluetooth headphones</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Power: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">External power source (e.g. compatible battery bank, sold separately)</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Hot Swapping Support: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Hot swap power sources and preserve running processes on device for up to 5 minutes with the built-in uninterruptible power supply system</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Vision Support: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Adjustable diopter dials that allows easy focus adjustment for each lens</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Controllers: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Can use connected phone as controller</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Video Pass-through: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Yes. Supports video pass-through for environmental awareness</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Tracking: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">2x cameras for inside-out headset 6DoF tracking</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Connectivity: </strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">USB-C, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-spec-list-item\">\n<div class=\"type20-promote-head text-fix-widow\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"type20-promote-head text-fix-widow\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"type20-promote-head text-fix-widow\"><strong>Helpful information</strong></div>\n<div class=\"type20-promote-head text-fix-widow\">\n<ol>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Complete setup of your VIVE Flow in the VIVE app to receive a redemption code for the 2-month VIVEPORT Infinity subscription via email. Subscribers will be automatically charged for each month of membership after the 2-month period. Limited time offer. Subject to change.</span>\n</li>\n<li><span>VIVE Flow requires a separate power source and must be wirelessly paired with either a compatible smartphone or a Controller for VIVE Flow, each sold separately.</span></li>\n<li><span>Content available for streaming to VR is dependent on phone compatibility and individual subscriptions to services like Hulu, Netflix, and Disney+.</span></li>\n<li><span>The Controller for VIVE Flow can be used with VIVE Flow units running software 1.63.623.04 or higher; other units must first be paired with a compatible phone to receive the software update.</span></li>\n<li><span>VIVE Flow's dual-hinge design allows the device to fit around most head shapes and sizes.</span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
